<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tuyết | Makeup Artist & Academy Portfolio</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome Font Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0B0C0E;
            --bg-card: #141518;
            --bg-card-hover: #1C1E22;
            --gold-primary: #E6C280;
            --gold-light: #FFF0D0;
            --text-bright: #FFFFFF;
            --text-sub: #D1D5DB;
            --text-muted: #9CA3AF;
            --border-gold: rgba(230, 194, 128, 0.3);
            --font-head: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            --font-body: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark) !important;
            color: var(--text-bright) !important;
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        /* HEADER & NAVIGATION */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(11, 12, 14, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
        }

        .nav-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 80px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--gold-primary);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .nav-menu a {
            color: var(--text-bright);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-menu a:hover {
            color: var(--gold-primary);
        }

        .btn-gold {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E6C280 0%, #B8860B 100%);
            color: #000000 !important;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(230, 194, 128, 0.2);
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-gold:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(230, 194, 128, 0.4);
        }

        /* HERO SECTION */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(11, 12, 14, 0.8), rgba(11, 12, 14, 0.95)),
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522337360788-8b13dee7a37e?q=80&w=1600') center/cover no-repeat;
            padding-top: 100px;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .hero-sub {
            color: var(--gold-primary);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 3.8rem;
            color: var(--text-bright);
            line-height: 1.15;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-desc {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 35px auto;
        }

        /* SECTION STYLES */
        section {
            padding: 90px 0;
        }

        .sec-title-box {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .sec-subtitle {
            color: var(--gold-primary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .sec-title {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: var(--text-bright);
        }

        /* BEFORE & AFTER SHOWCASE */
        .ba-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .ba-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .ba-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
        }

        .ba-photos {
            display: flex;
            height: 280px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .ba-photo-box {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .ba-photo-box img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .ba-tag {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 12px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            z-index: 5;
        }

        .tag-before {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            color: var(--text-bright);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .tag-after {
            background: var(--gold-primary);
            color: #000;
        }

        .ba-divider {
            width: 2px;
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            z-index: 4;
        }

        .ba-content {
            padding: 22px;
        }

        .ba-heading {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .ba-text {
            color: var(--text-sub);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* PORTFOLIO GALLERY */
        .filter-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .filter-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            color: var(--text-sub);
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .filter-btn.active, .filter-btn:hover {
            background: var(--gold-primary);
            color: #000;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .gallery-card {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            aspect-ratio: 3/4;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }

        .gallery-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .gallery-card:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.08);
        }

        .gallery-info {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.9) 0%, transparent 70%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding: 20px;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-info {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .gallery-cat {
            color: var(--gold-primary);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .gallery-name {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--text-bright);
        }

        /* SERVICES & PRICING */
        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .service-box {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .service-box:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            background: var(--bg-card-hover);
        }

        .service-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--gold-primary);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .service-price {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .service-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 20px 0 30px 0;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .service-list li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* ABOUT SECTION */
        .about-flex {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-img {
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
        }

        .about-img img {
            width: 100%;
            display: block;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .about-text h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--gold-primary);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .about-text p {
            color: var(--text-sub);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* BOOKING FORM */
        .form-box {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(230, 194, 128, 0.2);
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: var(--text-bright);
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            outline: none;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: var(--gold-primary);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        .form-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            padding: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
            background: #060708;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .socials {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .socials a {
            color: var(--gold-primary);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .socials a:hover {
            color: var(--text-bright);
        }

        /* LIGHTBOX MODAL */
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 2000;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.92);
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .modal.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        .modal-img {
            max-width: 90%;
            max-height: 85vh;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-primary);
        }

        .modal-close {
            position: absolute;
            top: 25px;
            right: 35px;
            color: var(--text-bright);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-title { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .nav-menu { display: none; }
            .about-flex, .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .ba-photos { height: 220px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header>
        <div class="container nav-wrapper">
            <a href="#" class="logo">TUYẾT MAKEUP</a>
            <ul class="nav-menu">
                <li><a href="#before-after">Trước & Sau</a></li>
                <li><a href="#gallery">Bộ Sưu Tập</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">Về Tôi</a></li>
                <li><a href="#services">Dịch Vụ</a></li>
                <li><a href="#booking">Đặt Lịch</a></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#booking" class="btn-gold">Đặt Lịch Ngay</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <p class="hero-sub">Professional Makeup Artist & Educator</p>
            <h1 class="hero-title">Tôn Vinh Vẻ Đẹp Tự Nhiên & Sang Trọng</h1>
            <p class="hero-desc">Chuyên trang điểm Cô Dâu, Dự Tiệc Cao Cấp và Đào Tạo Học Viên Chuyên Nghiệp từ cơ bản đến nâng cao.</p>
            <a href="#before-after" class="btn-gold" style="padding: 14px 36px;">Xem Tác Phẩm</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Before & After Section (Side-by-Side) -->
    <section id="before-after">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="sec-title-box">
                <p class="sec-subtitle">Sự Biến Hóa Kỳ Diệu</p>
                <h2 class="sec-title">Hình Ảnh Trước & Sau Makeup</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="ba-grid">
                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div class="ba-card">
                    <div class="ba-photos">
                        <div class="ba-photo-box">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512496015851-a90fb38ba796?q=80&w=600" alt="Mặt mộc trước makeup">
                            <span class="ba-tag tag-before">BEFORE</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ba-divider"></div>
                        <div class="ba-photo-box">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522337360788-8b13dee7a37e?q=80&w=600" alt="Sau khi trang điểm cô dâu">
                            <span class="ba-tag tag-after">AFTER</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ba-content">
                        <h3 class="ba-heading">Makeup Cô Dâu Trong Trẻo</h3>
                        <p class="ba-text">Tạo lớp nền căng bóng bắt sáng, che phủ khuyết điểm hoàn hảo giữ vẻ đẹp tự nhiên.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div class="ba-card">
                    <div class="ba-photos">
                        <div class="ba-photo-box">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509967419530-da38b4704bc6?q=80&w=600" alt="Học viên trước trang điểm">
                            <span class="ba-tag tag-before">BEFORE</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ba-divider"></div>
                        <div class="ba-photo-box">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516975080664-ed2fc6a32937?q=80&w=600" alt="Học viên sau trang điểm">
                            <span class="ba-tag tag-after">AFTER</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ba-content">
                        <h3 class="ba-heading">Bài Thực Hành Học Viên K15</h3>
                        <p class="ba-text">Tác phẩm tone Tây cuốn hút do chính tay học viên thực hiện sau 1 tháng đào tạo.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div class="ba-card">
                    <div class="ba-photos">
                        <div class="ba-photo-box">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?q=80&w=600" alt="Khách trước makeup">
                            <span class="ba-tag tag-before">BEFORE</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ba-divider"></div>
                        <div class="ba-photo-box">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f?q=80&w=600" alt="Khách sau makeup tiệc">
                            <span class="ba-tag tag-after">AFTER</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ba-content">
                        <h3 class="ba-heading">Makeup Dự Tiệc Sang Trọng</h3>
                        <p class="ba-text">Nhấn mắt sâu quyến rũ kết hợp sắc môi đỏ đất thời thượng cho buổi tiệc tối.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Portfolio Gallery -->
    <section id="gallery" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="sec-title-box">
                <p class="sec-subtitle">Portfolio</p>
                <h2 class="sec-title">Bộ Sưu Tập Tác Phẩm</h2>
            </div>

            <!-- Filter Buttons -->
            <div class="filter-bar">
                <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="filterGallery('all', this)">Tất Cả</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterGallery('bridal', this)">Cô Dâu</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterGallery('party', this)">Dự Tiệc</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterGallery('student', this)">Tác Phẩm Học Viên</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Gallery Grid -->
            <div class="gallery-grid">
                <div class="gallery-card" data-cat="bridal" onclick="showModal(this)">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?q=80&w=600" alt="Cô Dâu 1">
                    <div class="gallery-info">
                        <span class="gallery-cat">Cô Dâu</span>
                        <h4 class="gallery-name">Phong Cách Hàn Quốc</h4>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card" data-cat="party" onclick="showModal(this)">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509967419530-da38b4704bc6?q=80&w=600" alt="Dự Tiệc 1">
                    <div class="gallery-info">
                        <span class="gallery-cat">Dự Tiệc</span>
                        <h4 class="gallery-name">Glamour Night</h4>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card" data-cat="student" onclick="showModal(this)">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516975080664-ed2fc6a32937?q=80&w=600" alt="Học Viên 1">
                    <div class="gallery-info">
                        <span class="gallery-cat">Học Viên</span>
                        <h4 class="gallery-name">Bài Kiểm Tra Cuối Khóa</h4>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card" data-cat="bridal" onclick="showModal(this)">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522337360788-8b13dee7a37e?q=80&w=600" alt="Cô Dâu 2">
                    <div class="gallery-info">
                        <span class="gallery-cat">Cô Dâu</span>
                        <h4 class="gallery-name">Tone Cam Đào Ngọt Ngào</h4>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card" data-cat="party" onclick="showModal(this)">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f?q=80&w=600" alt="Dự Tiệc 2">
                    <div class="gallery-info">
                        <span class="gallery-cat">Dự Tiệc</span>
                        <h4 class="gallery-name">Smokey Eyes Quyến Rũ</h4>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card" data-cat="student" onclick="showModal(this)">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512496015851-a90fb38ba796?q=80&w=600" alt="Học Viên 2">
                    <div class="gallery-info">
                        <span class="gallery-cat">Học Viên</span>
                        <h4 class="gallery-name">Kỹ Thuật Nhấn Cầu Mắt</h4>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section id="about">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-flex">
                <div class="about-img">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522337360788-8b13dee7a37e?q=80&w=800" alt="Artist Portrait">
                </div>
                <div class="about-text">
                    <p class="sec-subtitle">Về Tôi</p>
                    <h3>Tuyết - Senior Makeup Artist</h3>
                    <p>Với hơn 8 năm hoạt động trong ngành làm đẹp chuyên nghiệp, tôi luôn tâm niệm rằng makeup không phải là biến đổi bạn thành một người khác, mà là làm nổi bật những đường nét xinh đẹp nhất vốn có của bạn.</p>
                    <p>Bên cạnh dịch vụ trang điểm, tôi dành trọn tâm huyết cho các khóa học đào tạo học viên từ cơ bản đến nâng cao, giúp các bạn trẻ vững bước trên con đường làm đẹp chuyên nghiệp.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services & Pricing -->
    <section id="services" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="sec-title-box">
                <p class="sec-subtitle">Dịch Vụ & Khóa Học</p>
                <h2 class="sec-title">Bảng Giá Dịch Vụ</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="services-grid">
                <!-- Service 1 -->
                <div class="service-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles service-icon"></i>
                    <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright);">Makeup Dự Tiệc</h3>
